sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Web as Web
  participant Filter as Auth Filter
  participant Controller as Controller
  participant Service as Service
  participant Idem as Idempotency
  participant Repo as Repository
  participant DB as PostgreSQL RLS
  participant Audit as Audit Log

  Web->>Filter: HTTP request + Bearer token
  Filter->>Filter: 校验 token / session / permissions
  Filter->>Controller: AuthPrincipal
  Controller->>Controller: 参数校验
  alt 写接口
    Controller->>Idem: 校验 Idempotency-Key
    Idem-->>Controller: 可执行或返回历史结果
  end
  Controller->>Service: DTO + principal
  Service->>Service: 业务规则 / 状态机
  Service->>Repo: 查询或写入
  Repo->>DB: set tenant context + SQL
  DB-->>Repo: 当前租户数据
  Repo-->>Service: domain result
  Service->>Audit: 写操作日志 / 差异日志
  Service-->>Controller: result
  Controller-->>Web: ApiResponse
